---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: products-bridge.html
title: 교량이음장치
description: 교량의 온도 변화·진동·하중에 의한 변위를 흡수하는 하이탑 교량이음장치 6개 제품군과 나라장터 물품식별번호·규격 안내.
bodyClass: bg-surface text-ink
---

<!-- ══ BRIDGE VISUAL — 다음 콘텐츠가 첫 화면에 함께 보이는 낮은 이미지 블록 ══ -->
<section class="relative mt-20 h-[36vh] min-h-[280px] max-h-[380px] overflow-hidden bg-night">
  <picture class="absolute inset-0 block h-full w-full">
    <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="{{ '/images/delivery/joint-complete.jpg' | url }}">
    <img src="{{ '/images/delivery/joint-installation.jpg' | url }}" alt="하이탑 교량이음장치 시공 현장"
         class="h-full w-full object-cover object-[center_52%]" fetchpriority="high">
  </picture>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-night/45"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-44 bg-gradient-to-t from-night/70 to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="container-hi relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col justify-end pb-9 text-white sm:pb-11">
    <nav class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-white/60" aria-label="브레드크럼">
      <a href="{{ '/' | url }}" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">홈</a>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">chevron_right</span>
      <span class="text-white/90">교량이음장치</span>
    </nav>
    <span class="eyebrow-line !text-white/60">Bridge Expansion Joint</span>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white [text-shadow:0_2px_18px_rgba(11,14,19,0.45)] sm:text-4xl">교량이음장치</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ PRODUCT INDEX ══ -->
<section id="product-index" class="scroll-mt-20 border-b border-line bg-surface py-14 lg:py-20">
  <div class="container-hi">
    <div class="grid items-end gap-7 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <span class="eyebrow-line">Product Portfolio</span>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-4xl">현장 조건에 맞춘 6개 제품군</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="border-t border-ink/15 pt-5 leading-relaxed text-secondary lg:col-span-5">
        교량의 온도 변화·진동·하중에 의한 변위를 흡수하여 구조물을 보호하는 핵심 제품입니다.
        아래 제품을 선택하면 제품별 특징과 적용 규격, 나라장터 물품식별번호를 바로 확인할 수 있습니다.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {% for p in products.bridge %}
        <a href="#{{ p.id }}" aria-label="{{ p.nameKo }} 상세 정보로 이동" class="group overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-white ring-1 ring-line transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:ring-primary/25 hover:shadow-[0_18px_45px_rgba(25,28,29,0.11)] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary">
          <div class="relative h-48 overflow-hidden {% if p.id == 'monocell' or p.id == 'finger-new' %}bg-white{% else %}bg-night{% endif %}">
            <span class="absolute left-5 top-4 z-10 font-display text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.18em] {% if p.id == 'monocell' or p.id == 'finger-new' %}text-ink/30{% else %}text-white/40{% endif %}">{{ p.num }}</span>
            <img src="{{ p.img | url }}" alt="{{ p.nameEn }} — {{ p.nameKo }}"
                 class="h-full w-full object-contain p-5 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-105" loading="lazy"
                 onerror="this.style.display='none'">
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4 border-t border-line p-5 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-primary/[0.025]">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-extrabold text-ink">{{ p.nameEn }}</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-secondary">{{ p.nameKo }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="shrink-0 text-right">
              <span class="block font-display text-[0.62rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-secondary/70">
                {% if p.spec.idCol is defined %}나라장터 {{ p.spec.rows | length }} 규격{% else %}표준 {{ p.spec.rows | length }} 규격{% endif %}
              </span>
              <span class="mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-bold text-primary">
                제품 상세보기
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ PRODUCT CHAPTERS — 모든 문구·규격은 products.json에서 직접 출력 ══ -->
{% for p in products.bridge %}
  <section id="{{ p.id }}" class="scroll-mt-20 border-b border-line {% if loop.index % 2 == 0 %}bg-white{% else %}bg-surface{% endif %}">
    <div class="container-hi py-20 lg:py-28">
      <header class="grid gap-6 border-b border-ink/15 pb-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-end">
        <div class="lg:col-span-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <span class="font-display text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.22em] text-accent">{{ p.num }}</span>
            <span class="h-px w-12 bg-accent"></span>
            <span class="font-display text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-secondary/70">Bridge Expansion Joint</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="mt-5 font-display text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">{{ p.nameEn }}</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-secondary">{{ p.nameKo }}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 lg:col-span-4 lg:justify-end">
          {% if p.spec.idCol is defined %}
            <span class="rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/[0.05] px-4 py-2 font-display text-[0.68rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-primary">G2B {{ p.spec.rows | length }} Models</span>
          {% else %}
            <span class="rounded-full border border-ink/15 bg-white px-4 py-2 font-display text-[0.68rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-secondary">Standard {{ p.spec.rows | length }} Models</span>
          {% endif %}
          {% if p.patents.length %}
            <span class="rounded-full border border-ink/15 bg-white px-4 py-2 font-display text-[0.68rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-secondary">Patented</span>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="mt-10 grid items-stretch gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
        <figure class="relative min-h-[320px] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl ring-1 ring-line sm:min-h-[400px] lg:col-span-6 {% if p.id == 'monocell' or p.id == 'finger-new' %}bg-white{% else %}bg-night{% endif %}">
          <div class="technical-grid absolute inset-0 {% if p.id == 'monocell' or p.id == 'finger-new' %}opacity-30{% else %}opacity-[0.08]{% endif %}"></div>
          <span class="absolute bottom-4 right-6 font-display text-[5.5rem] font-extrabold leading-none tracking-[-0.08em] {% if p.id == 'monocell' or p.id == 'finger-new' %}text-ink/[0.035]{% else %}text-white/[0.045]{% endif %}">{{ p.num }}</span>
          <img src="{{ p.img | url }}" alt="{{ p.nameEn }} — {{ p.nameKo }}"
               class="relative z-10 h-full min-h-[320px] w-full object-contain p-7 sm:min-h-[400px] sm:p-12" loading="lazy"
               onerror="this.style.display='none'">
        </figure>

        <div class="flex flex-col justify-between lg:col-span-6">
          <div>
            <p class="font-display text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-secondary/70">Key Performance</p>
            <div class="mt-5">
              {% for f in p.features %}
                <div class="grid grid-cols-[2.75rem_1fr] gap-4 border-t border-ink/12 py-5 {% if loop.last %}border-b{% endif %}">
                  <span class="font-display text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink/18">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
                  <p class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink/80">{{ f }}</p>
                </div>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          </div>

          {% if p.patents.length %}
            <div class="mt-7">
              <p class="mb-3 font-display text-[0.62rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary/70">Applied Patents</p>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                {% for pt in p.patents %}
                  <span class="chip-patent">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined !text-sm" aria-hidden="true" style="font-variation-settings:'FILL' 1">verified</span>
                    특허 {{ pt }}
                  </span>
                {% endfor %}
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      {% if p.materials %}
        <section class="mt-12 border-t border-ink/15 pt-8" aria-labelledby="{{ p.id }}-materials">
          <div class="mb-5 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <p class="font-display text-[0.62rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary/70">Material List</p>
              <h3 id="{{ p.id }}-materials" class="mt-2 text-xl font-extrabold text-ink">주요 구성 재료</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs text-secondary">단위와 재질은 제품 데이터 기준</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-table-wrap bridge-table-wrap">
            <table class="spec-table bridge-spec-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>{% for h in p.materials.head %}<th>{{ h }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                {% for row in p.materials.rows %}
                  <tr>{% for c in row %}<td>{{ c }}</td>{% endfor %}</tr>
                {% endfor %}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </section>
      {% endif %}

      <section class="mt-12 border-t border-ink/15 pt-8" aria-labelledby="{{ p.id }}-specs">
        <div class="mb-5 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <p class="font-display text-[0.62rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary/70">Technical Specifications</p>
            <h3 id="{{ p.id }}-specs" class="mt-2 text-xl font-extrabold text-ink">{{ p.specTitle or "규격 · Specifications" }}</h3>
          </div>
          {% if p.spec.idCol is defined %}
            <p class="max-w-md text-right text-xs leading-relaxed text-secondary">강조된 번호는 나라장터에서 조회·발주할 수 있는 물품식별번호입니다.</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="spec-table-wrap bridge-table-wrap">
          <table class="spec-table bridge-spec-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>{% for h in p.spec.head %}<th>{{ h }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {% for row in p.spec.rows %}
                <tr>
                  {% for c in row %}
                    <td {% if p.spec.idCol is defined and p.spec.idCol == loop.index0 %}class="id-col"{% endif %}>{{ c }}</td>
                  {% endfor %}
                </tr>
              {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        {% if p.note %}<p class="mt-4 border-l-2 border-accent pl-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-secondary">{{ p.note }}</p>{% endif %}
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
{% endfor %}

{% set ctaTitle = "현장 조건에 맞는 교량이음장치가 필요하신가요?" %}
{% set ctaDesc = "신축량 · 교량 형식 · 설치 조건 · 수량을 알려주시면 적합한 제품과 나라장터 물품식별번호를 안내해 드립니다." %}
{% set ctaSecondary = { label: "납품실적 보기", url: "/delivery.html" } %}
{% include "partials/cta-band.njk" %}
